# Internal Replit dev artifacts — kept local only, never published.
# `attached_assets/` was a dumping ground for screenshots, draft prompts and
# unused image generations during development. The 6 illustrations actually
# rendered by the UI now live in artifacts/vessel/src/assets/illustrations/.
# `replit.md` is the AI agent's project memory — useful to keep on disk so
# tooling can read it across sessions, but not appropriate for the public repo.
/attached_assets/
/replit.md
